        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Hytner, Maya Deren\n- Roles: theatre director, film director, film producer, filmmaker, choreographer, dancer, film theorist, poet, lecturer, writer, photographer\n- Topics: experimental film, avant-garde\n\nFacts:\n- Maya Deren was born as Eleanora Derenkowskaia on April 29, 1917, and she died on October 13, 1961.\n- Sir Nicholas Robert Hytner was born on 7 May 1956 and is an English theatre director, film director, and film producer.\n- Maya Deren was a Russian-American filmmaker and was one of the most important American experimental filmmakers and entrepreneurial promoters of the avant-garde in the 1940s and 1950s.\n- Maya Deren was also a choreographer, dancer, film theorist, poet, lecturer, writer, and photographer.",
